<% content_for :reason, "You're getting this because we shared #{@documents.one? ? "this" : "these"} with #{@contact.client.name}. You can turn these off in the portal, under your account." %>
Hi <%= @contact.name.split.first %>,

We've shared <%= @documents.one? ? "this" : "these" %> with you:
<% @documents.first(10).each do |document| %>
- <%= document.filename %>
<% end %>
<% if @documents.size > 10 %>
And <%= @documents.size - 10 %> more.
<% end %>

See your documents: <%= @url %>
